+# Owned account PP fixture
+
+`pp-account.osu` is synthetic Boshsu qualification content with 252 circles. It needs no copyrighted map/audio files for CPU PP tests. The historical supplied Bosh ABI returns **46.719 PP** for the account test's fixed 218×300, 1×50, 33 misses and 50 combo vector. This value was captured from the sealed RC6 runtime before the optimization, rather than invented from the candidate.
+
+`tools/Test-Accounts.ps1` uses this map/vector by default. An explicit external reference map must supply its own sealed expected raw value with `-ExpectedRawPP`; the older reference fixture default was 10.37. Runtime gameplay fixtures require their own owned audio and are separate.
